G04*
G04  General MACRO for flashed round with rotation and/or offset hole *
%AMROTOFFROUND*
1,1,$1,0.0000,0.0000*
1,0,$2,$3,$4*%
G04*
G04  General MACRO for flashed oval (obround) with rotation and/or offset hole *
%AMROTOFFOVAL*
21,1,$1,$2,0.0000,0.0000,$3*
1,1,$4,$5,$6*
1,1,$4,0-$5,0-$6*
1,0,$7,$8,$9*%
