G04*
G04  General MACRO for target *
%AMTARGET*
6,0,0,$1,$2,$3,4,$4,$5,$6*%
G04*
G04  General MACRO for mounting hole *
%AMMTHOLE*
1,1,$1,0,0*
1,0,$2,0,0*
$1=$1-$2*
$1=$1/2*
